WEBVTT

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:15.833
"Monday, July 6, 2026 5:10 PM"

00:00:28.875 --> 00:00:30.292
Are you ready?

00:00:30.292 --> 00:00:31.667
Yes.

00:00:31.667 --> 00:00:33.417
Anytime you're ready, please.

00:00:33.417 --> 00:00:35.125
Ms. Asuna.

00:00:35.125 --> 00:00:41.667
You'll be using the superuser account 01,
Stacia, the Goddess of Creation, 'kay?

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:48.292
Although this account gives you admin rights to
run the unlimited landscape alteration command,

00:00:48.292 --> 00:00:54.292
since there's so much data being transferred
between the STL and the Main Visualizer,

00:00:54.292 --> 00:00:57.292
it can seriously overload your Fluctlight, 'kay?

00:00:57.292 --> 00:01:01.167
So please try not to alter
the landscape recklessly.

00:01:01.167 --> 00:01:07.250
If you feel a headache starting while using
the command, stop doing it right away, 'kay?

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:08.250
Okay.

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:12.417
Ms. Yuuki. I'm counting on you
to take care of Kirito.

00:01:12.417 --> 00:01:14.083
Of course.

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:25.250
"Dark Territory Shrubland
Human Army Supply Corps"

00:03:05.042 --> 00:03:09.042
"Stacia, the Goddess of Creation"

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:17.417
So this is the side effect
of landscape alteration.

00:03:17.417 --> 00:03:21.208
Where? Where are you, Kirito?

00:03:25.250 --> 00:03:27.750
Lady Stacia?

00:03:28.833 --> 00:03:33.208
Are you... a god?

00:03:33.208 --> 00:03:37.292
No. I'm sorry. I'm not a god.

00:03:37.292 --> 00:03:43.833
But... But you just performed a miracle
and saved my life!

00:03:43.833 --> 00:03:49.083
You've saved the guards, the monks
and Kirito-<i>senpai</i>, as well.

00:03:49.083 --> 00:03:50.792
I...

00:03:50.792 --> 00:03:56.167
I've come here just to see him... to see Kirito.

00:03:56.167 --> 00:03:57.750
Please...

00:03:57.750 --> 00:03:59.833
Where is he?

00:03:59.833 --> 00:04:01.792
Let me see him!

00:04:01.792 --> 00:04:04.417
Please take me to Kirito!

00:04:07.333 --> 00:04:08.667
--Right.
--Right.

00:04:08.667 --> 00:04:10.375
--This way.
--This way.

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:28.458
Kirito.

00:04:43.417 --> 00:04:47.625
Kirito, it's all right. That's enough.

00:04:59.583 --> 00:05:03.917
Thank you. You've been
protecting Kirito, haven't you?

00:05:05.458 --> 00:05:10.833
Um... if you're not Lady Stacia,
then who are you?

00:05:10.833 --> 00:05:13.000
My name is Asuna.

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:15.250
I'm a human being, just like you.

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:18.917
Just like Kirito,
I've come from the outside world.

00:05:18.917 --> 00:05:22.125
In order to fulfill the same goal.

00:05:22.125 --> 00:05:25.417
--The same world as Kirito-<i>senpai</i>?
--The same world as Kirito-<i>senpai</i>?

00:05:25.417 --> 00:05:29.250
D-Do you mean the Divine Realm?

00:05:29.250 --> 00:05:35.792
The Celestial Realm where the three goddesses of creation,
the gods of the elements, and the angels live?

00:05:35.792 --> 00:05:40.875
Not that. Although it is a world
that exists outside of this one.

00:05:40.875 --> 00:05:44.875
I'm sorry. I can't really
describe it in one word.

00:05:44.875 --> 00:05:49.833
I'd like to explain it to the people in command
here, so could you take me to them?

00:05:49.833 --> 00:05:54.125
Y-Yes. Understood. Please come this way.

00:05:58.917 --> 00:06:03.833
It's all right. Everything's
all right now, Kirito.

00:06:03.833 --> 00:06:06.250
Just leave the rest to me.

00:06:18.375 --> 00:06:21.083
L-Lady Knight! Please stop!

00:06:21.083 --> 00:06:24.125
She's not the enemy! Lady Alice--

00:06:24.125 --> 00:06:25.583
Alice?

00:06:25.583 --> 00:06:27.375
Who are you?

00:06:27.375 --> 00:06:30.375
Why did you go near Kirito?

00:06:30.375 --> 00:06:32.083
Why, you ask?

00:06:32.083 --> 00:06:33.917
Because Kirito belongs to me!

00:06:33.917 --> 00:06:36.917
What are you talking about, you savage?

00:06:42.208 --> 00:06:46.542
Now this is truly a magnificent sight to behold.

00:06:46.542 --> 00:06:49.375
Two beautiful flowers bursting into bloom.

00:06:50.375 --> 00:06:53.583
Man, it's glorious.

00:06:58.917 --> 00:07:00.917
Why would you interrupt me?

00:07:00.917 --> 00:07:03.833
Uncle, she must be an enemy spy.

00:07:03.833 --> 00:07:06.167
I don't think so.

00:07:06.167 --> 00:07:12.000
Because just as I was about to meet
my untimely demise in battle,

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:14.833
it was this young lady who saved my life.

00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:18.458
I saw it.

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:23.458
So they're here.

00:07:34.917 --> 00:07:37.833
A rainbow of light came down from the heavens,

00:07:37.833 --> 00:07:40.500
and the earth split open 100 mel wide.

00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:45.125
Even those pugilists were flustered
because they couldn't make the jump.

00:07:45.125 --> 00:07:48.250
That we were this close
to being wiped out in one fell swoop

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:53.208
and this young lady saved us
is an undeniable fact.

00:07:53.208 --> 00:07:56.958
Then are you saying
that this person isn't an enemy spy,

00:07:56.958 --> 00:08:00.542
nor an immoral imposter dressed like
a divine entity depicted in holy art,

00:08:00.542 --> 00:08:04.375
but rather the real goddess, Stacia?

00:08:04.375 --> 00:08:06.292
I don't think that.

00:08:06.292 --> 00:08:11.667
If this young lady were an actual god, then she'd
be scarier than the pontifex, wouldn't she?

00:08:11.667 --> 00:08:17.917
She'd hurl someone rude enough to attack her
at first sight into the depths of the earth.

00:08:24.583 --> 00:08:29.667
Yes. As you say, I'm not a god.

00:08:29.667 --> 00:08:32.083
I'm a human, like all of you.

00:08:32.083 --> 00:08:37.458
But I do have some knowledge
of the situation you're in right now.

00:08:39.208 --> 00:08:44.375
The rest of your story should be heard
by the other knights and guards, as well.

00:08:44.375 --> 00:08:46.542
Let's talk about this over tea.

00:08:46.542 --> 00:08:48.333
Very well.

00:08:48.333 --> 00:08:50.792
Right, now that that's settled.

00:08:50.792 --> 00:08:53.417
You young ladies over there!

00:08:53.417 --> 00:08:57.167
Could you get us some hot tea,
and some liquor for me?

00:08:57.167 --> 00:09:00.375
You should listen in, too.

00:09:00.375 --> 00:09:01.667
--Yes, sir!
--Yes, sir!

00:09:08.125 --> 00:09:09.917
I want to make one thing clear.

00:09:10.875 --> 00:09:14.917
From now on, you are not to enter
that carriage without my permission.

00:09:14.917 --> 00:09:19.708
As it is my duty to ensure Kirito's safety.

00:09:19.708 --> 00:09:24.667
You, too! Stop referring to my Kirito
in such a familiar way!

00:09:24.667 --> 00:09:27.167
Did you say something?

00:09:27.167 --> 00:09:29.125
No, nothing.

00:09:34.958 --> 00:09:38.417
It looks like things are going
to get intense, huh?

00:09:38.417 --> 00:09:41.125
Come on, we need to boil some water right away!

00:09:41.125 --> 00:09:45.417
The liquor jug's in that carriage
over there, right? Let's go, Ronie!

00:09:50.542 --> 00:09:54.125
He's my <i>senpai</i>...

00:09:56.292 --> 00:09:58.417
It's nice to meet you all.

00:09:58.417 --> 00:10:00.583
My name is Asuna.

00:10:00.583 --> 00:10:03.292
I've come here from the outside world.

00:10:03.292 --> 00:10:07.958
By "outside," I don't mean that this world
that you all live in, the Underworld,

00:10:07.958 --> 00:10:12.542
is psychically connected
to the real world I came from.

00:10:12.542 --> 00:10:14.750
They're totally separate worlds.

00:10:15.792 --> 00:10:24.208
And now, in a specific location in the real world,
two forces are fighting for control of the Underworld.

00:10:24.208 --> 00:10:27.958
I was sent from Rath, one of those forces.

00:10:27.958 --> 00:10:32.292
Then did you come to this world to rule over it?

00:10:32.292 --> 00:10:37.250
The opposite, actually.
My objective is to protect the Underworld.

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:44.583
And the objective of the force opposing us is to
extract a single person from the Underworld,

00:10:44.583 --> 00:10:48.125
and then destroy this world completely.

00:10:48.125 --> 00:10:49.625
Destroy this world?

00:10:49.625 --> 00:10:51.000
That's ridiculous.

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:53.458
In the first place, what's this "outside world"?

00:10:53.458 --> 00:10:55.750
It's the same thing.

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:59.042
Outside the Human Empire
lies the Dark Territory,

00:10:59.042 --> 00:11:05.083
where a colossal force of tens of thousands
has been more than eager to invade us.

00:11:05.083 --> 00:11:10.250
That's a fact that no one, including me,
has ever given any serious thought to.

00:11:10.250 --> 00:11:14.000
So what if there's one more world
on the outside now?

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:15.917
It's not a big deal.

00:11:15.917 --> 00:11:23.042
So this force that's intent on destroying this world,
who's the single person they want to seize?

00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:29.750
M-Me?

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:34.208
I see. So that's what this
"Priestess of Light" is about, huh?

00:11:34.208 --> 00:11:36.917
There isn't much time left.

00:11:36.917 --> 00:11:43.708
The only way to prevent the Underworld's annihilation
is to take Alice to the real world with me.

00:11:43.708 --> 00:11:48.542
Once they know that Alice is no longer here,
the enemy should stop interfering with this world.

00:11:48.542 --> 00:11:50.833
Y-You must be joking!

00:11:50.833 --> 00:11:52.875
Run away? Me?

00:11:52.875 --> 00:11:57.292
Abandon this world and everyone who lives here,
to go to this real world?

00:11:57.292 --> 00:12:00.000
That will never happen!
I am an Integrity Knight!

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:03.750
Protecting the Human Empire
is my gravest and only duty!

00:12:03.750 --> 00:12:05.417
Then that's all the more reason.

00:12:05.417 --> 00:12:12.208
If the enemy, not the land of darkness,
but the invaders from the real world capture you,

00:12:12.208 --> 00:12:18.333
then everyone who lives in this world,
the land, the skies, everything will be erased!

00:12:18.333 --> 00:12:21.208
The enemy could attack this place
at any moment!

00:12:21.208 --> 00:12:26.125
Whoa. About that,
your information's outdated, little Asuna.

00:12:26.125 --> 00:12:29.917
It seems like these guys you call
the enemy are already here.

00:12:32.625 --> 00:12:34.958
Now it all makes sense.

00:12:34.958 --> 00:12:39.042
The Priestess of Light
and the Dark God Vecta, who's after her.

00:12:39.042 --> 00:12:46.333
This god, Vecta, who's leading the enemy force right now,
must no doubt be a human from the real world like you.

00:12:46.333 --> 00:12:49.125
Dark God...

00:12:49.125 --> 00:12:55.042
My goodness. Then the superuser accounts for
the Dark Territory must not have been locked.

00:12:55.042 --> 00:12:58.250
Um, m-may I ask something?

00:12:58.250 --> 00:13:02.417
What exactly is the Priestess of Light, anyway?

00:13:02.417 --> 00:13:08.667
And why do these invaders from the real world
want Lady Alice so badly?

00:13:08.667 --> 00:13:11.208
Because she broke the Seal of the Right Eye.

00:13:11.208 --> 00:13:15.667
Y-You knew about that, Lady Sheyta? But how?

00:13:15.667 --> 00:13:18.208
Whenever I think about it,
my right eye hurts.

00:13:18.208 --> 00:13:23.208
The hardest thing in the world,
the indestructible Central Cathedral.

00:13:23.208 --> 00:13:28.375
If I could just slash the whole thing,
what fun that would be.

00:13:28.375 --> 00:13:34.208
Well, I bet there are others here
who've experienced the same thing.

00:13:34.208 --> 00:13:39.917
I'm referring to how the slightest doubt about
the pontifex's authority or the Axiom Church's system

00:13:39.917 --> 00:13:45.083
triggers a flashing red light in your right
eyeball, along with a searing pain.

00:13:45.083 --> 00:13:49.958
Normally, the pain is so severe
that you'd lose that thought,

00:13:49.958 --> 00:13:54.375
but should those blasphemous thoughts continue,
the pain intensifies drastically,

00:13:54.375 --> 00:13:57.958
and the right side of your vision
turns red. Until finally...

00:13:57.958 --> 00:14:02.208
Your entire right eye explodes completely.

00:14:02.208 --> 00:14:04.667
Then, Lady Alice...

00:14:06.250 --> 00:14:12.167
I fought Prime Senator Chudelkin,
as well as the pontifex, Administrator.

00:14:12.167 --> 00:14:17.083
In order to muster the resolve to do so,
I temporarily lost my right eye.

00:14:17.083 --> 00:14:18.875
Come to think of it...

00:14:18.875 --> 00:14:23.417
...when I fought Administrator,
there was something about my right eye...

00:14:23.417 --> 00:14:26.917
I believe it was Code 8... 7...

00:14:26.917 --> 00:14:29.542
That's right! Code 871!

00:14:29.542 --> 00:14:33.792
That's what the pontifex
called the Seal of the Right Eye.

00:14:33.792 --> 00:14:36.792
She said it was Code 871,
imposed by "that person."

00:14:36.792 --> 00:14:39.417
At the time, I didn't know what she meant.

00:14:39.417 --> 00:14:43.625
But could this, too, be a word from the real
world, rather than an ancient sacred term?

00:14:43.625 --> 00:14:46.167
Code... 87... 1?

00:14:46.167 --> 00:14:50.000
That seal was put in place on the other side...
by someone from Rath?

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:53.500
But no, it would only get in the way
of their objective.

00:14:55.083 --> 00:15:00.000
Rath's goal is to create an AI
with true intelligence.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:04.250
Mr. Kikuoka and Mr. Higa
created the Underworld for that purpose,

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:07.083
and they've continued the
simulation for centuries.

00:15:07.083 --> 00:15:12.792
Since Mr. Kikuoka deliberately created an environment
for the AIs to violate the Taboo Index,

00:15:12.792 --> 00:15:17.417
having a code to force them into obedience
would defeat the purpose of the experiment.

00:15:17.417 --> 00:15:18.625
No way!

00:15:18.625 --> 00:15:21.125
Is the Seal of the Right Eye
a means of sabotage?

00:15:21.125 --> 00:15:24.375
Is it the enemy that's attacking us now?

00:15:24.375 --> 00:15:28.167
This is bad! There's a mole
among the Rath staff!

00:15:28.167 --> 00:15:30.708
On this side of the bulkhead!

00:15:30.708 --> 00:15:33.500
I have to let Mr. Kikuoka on the outside
know right away.

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:37.042
But how am I going to do that
if there are no system consoles nearby?

00:15:37.042 --> 00:15:38.500
Kirito!

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:43.250
Asuna.

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:44.708
Please...

00:15:47.958 --> 00:15:49.542
Is something wrong?

00:15:49.542 --> 00:15:51.625
No. I'm fine.

00:15:51.625 --> 00:15:58.208
As Alice said, Code 871, the Seal of the Right Eye,
was set up by someone from the real world.

00:15:58.208 --> 00:16:01.042
Someone on the enemy side.

00:16:01.042 --> 00:16:05.958
Isn't there any way to disable that code,
aside from blowing up the right eye?

00:16:05.958 --> 00:16:11.542
I don't think it's something that can be
disabled from inside the Underworld.

00:16:11.542 --> 00:16:14.667
In other words,
this enemy you're talking about

00:16:14.667 --> 00:16:19.000
wants to get their hands on someone who
broke the Seal of the Right Eye on their own.

00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:20.292
Let me ask you something.

00:16:20.292 --> 00:16:23.583
Do you real-world folks have the same seal?

00:16:23.583 --> 00:16:26.833
No. I have no such seal.

00:16:26.833 --> 00:16:33.750
Most likely, whether or not we're absolutely
forced to obey laws and commands

00:16:33.750 --> 00:16:37.375
is the one thing that sets apart
the real-worlders and the Underworlders.

00:16:37.375 --> 00:16:41.417
The enemy feared the one who would
break that seal in the Underworld.

00:16:41.417 --> 00:16:48.375
That the Priestess of Light, as they call her,
would appear, and then fall into the hands of others.

00:16:48.375 --> 00:16:54.292
That's because the Priestess of Light can very well
become extremely valuable in the real world.

00:16:54.292 --> 00:16:56.667
That's what I can't understand.

00:16:56.667 --> 00:17:01.167
If the only difference between us
and you real-worlders

00:17:01.167 --> 00:17:03.708
is whether or not we have
the Seal of the Right Eye,

00:17:03.708 --> 00:17:09.875
doesn't that make the Priestess of Light, in other words,
little Alice, an existence equal to a real-worlder?

00:17:09.875 --> 00:17:13.708
Then why are they obsessed
with the Priestess of Light?

00:17:13.708 --> 00:17:17.167
Whether it's the enemy or your people,

00:17:17.167 --> 00:17:21.917
what exactly do they want little Alice to do
once she's been taken to the outside world?

00:17:21.917 --> 00:17:23.708
Well...

00:17:23.708 --> 00:17:26.625
I'm sorry. I can't tell you now.

00:17:26.625 --> 00:17:32.792
Because what I want is for Ms. Alice to see the real
world with her own eyes, and then decide for herself.

00:17:32.792 --> 00:17:37.458
It's not a divine nation in any way,
nor is it a utopia.

00:17:37.458 --> 00:17:43.042
Far from it. Compared to this world,
it's way uglier and dirtier.

00:17:43.042 --> 00:17:46.167
But that's not all there is.

00:17:46.167 --> 00:17:50.917
There are so many people there who want to
protect this world and be friends with you all.

00:17:50.917 --> 00:17:53.833
That's right, just like Kirito.

00:17:56.500 --> 00:17:59.792
Very well. I won't ask you
anything else for now.

00:17:59.792 --> 00:18:03.250
However, we should first defeat
the enemy before us,

00:18:03.250 --> 00:18:06.542
and establish peace with the Dark Territory.

00:18:06.542 --> 00:18:09.000
The outside world can wait till afterwards.

00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:10.500
Right.

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:14.000
Now that I know that the Dark
God Vecta is from the real world,

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:18.208
it could be dangerous for you and me
to leave this unit by ourselves.

00:18:18.208 --> 00:18:21.500
I'm going to join you in this battle.

00:18:21.500 --> 00:18:25.000
Please let me take care of Vecta.

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:32.625
Sure, that would be a huge help, but can you do
that ground-splitting thing without limit?

00:18:32.625 --> 00:18:39.583
Unfortunately, I can probably only perform
large-scale land alterations once or twice more.

00:18:39.583 --> 00:18:45.125
How can we rely on an outsider's help
to protect our own Human Empire?

00:18:45.125 --> 00:18:47.875
It's our turn now to show what we can do.

00:18:47.875 --> 00:18:49.875
Right... that's right!

00:18:49.875 --> 00:18:54.917
Asuna's not a god. Didn't she just
say that she's a human like us?

00:18:54.917 --> 00:18:58.208
So we should be able to fight
just as well as her!

00:18:58.208 --> 00:19:02.167
I, too, would like to fight that pugilist again.

00:19:02.167 --> 00:19:06.125
The knights are absolutely right!
Let's do this ourselves!

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:12.042
I'll protect this world that
Kirito loved and lived in.

00:19:12.042 --> 00:19:13.917
From those mysterious attackers...

00:19:13.917 --> 00:19:16.458
...and from Rath as well.

00:19:23.875 --> 00:19:25.792
I figured you'd come.

00:19:33.500 --> 00:19:34.792
Let's make a deal.

00:19:34.792 --> 00:19:36.917
I'll let you see Kirito.

00:19:36.917 --> 00:19:39.333
And I'll tell you everything I know.

00:19:39.333 --> 00:19:46.125
In return, you need to tell me
everything you know about Kirito as well.

00:19:46.125 --> 00:19:47.375
That's fine!

00:19:47.375 --> 00:19:50.000
But it's a really long story.

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:52.167
It might take more than one night.

00:19:52.167 --> 00:19:54.542
How long have you spent with Kirito?

00:19:54.542 --> 00:19:58.167
Let's see. I fought as
his partner for two years.

00:19:58.167 --> 00:20:00.875
And then we dated for a year and a half.

00:20:00.875 --> 00:20:05.417
During which, we lived together for two weeks.

00:20:05.417 --> 00:20:09.375
I fought by his side for a full night.

00:20:09.375 --> 00:20:14.292
After that, I cared for him day and night for
six months while living under the same roof!

00:20:15.333 --> 00:20:17.417
Is that so?

00:20:17.417 --> 00:20:19.542
Excuse me.

00:20:19.542 --> 00:20:24.250
Um, I-I cleaned Kirito-<i>senpai</i>'s room
for about two months,

00:20:24.250 --> 00:20:26.792
and I also learned sword skills from him,

00:20:26.792 --> 00:20:30.750
not to mention that he treated me to honey pies
from the Prancing Deer Cafe more than once!

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:34.083
Compared to you two,
I was with him for a much shorter time,

00:20:34.083 --> 00:20:37.667
but, um, I'd like to trade information, too.

00:20:39.833 --> 00:20:44.292
All right. You're one of us, then, Ms. Ronie!

00:20:45.500 --> 00:20:50.167
This information exchange...
would you allow me to take part as well?

00:20:50.167 --> 00:20:52.917
I saw you in that meeting just now.

00:20:52.917 --> 00:20:58.333
I am Norlangarth Imperial
Knight Sortiliena Serlut.

00:20:58.333 --> 00:21:01.125
I was going to wait until the battle was over,

00:21:01.125 --> 00:21:07.833
but as I, too, have a close relationship with
Kirito, I couldn't stop myself from coming here.

00:21:07.833 --> 00:21:11.417
And what kind of relationship would
that be, Chief Guard Serlut?

00:21:11.417 --> 00:21:15.708
If you like, please call me Liena, Lady Knight.

00:21:15.708 --> 00:21:18.500
At the Norlangarth Imperial Swordcraft Academy,

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:24.667
Kirito waited on me as my primary
trainee page for a full year.

00:21:24.667 --> 00:21:29.375
In addition, I believe I was able to pass on
some of my sword skills to him.

00:21:31.875 --> 00:21:35.792
In that case, you must also
have plenty of information yourself!

00:21:35.792 --> 00:21:37.792
Please join us.

00:21:47.583 --> 00:21:49.333
What's wrong?

00:21:49.333 --> 00:21:51.250
"Dual-wielding Kirito."

00:21:51.250 --> 00:21:54.042
That's what people called him on the other side.

00:21:54.042 --> 00:21:55.625
Really?

00:22:01.333 --> 00:22:05.167
Then why don't we start there?

00:23:48.333 --> 00:23:52.192
Next time: "Heartless Choice."
